      "writtenOn": "2023-01-13T18:25:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, I had previously pushed for const SkData in some other CLs, because that\u0027s been the trend lately. writable_data definitely exists (and is used), so I think it\u0027s helpful to distinguish SkData that\u0027s really const. (Particularly when it\u0027s a non-owning SkData that points into data from another buffer).",
